=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">411a7987-bda0-43f6-a456-8e7bfb188d56</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:411a7987-bda0-43f6-a456-8e7bfb188d56\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:411a7987-bda0-43f6-a456-8e7bfb188d56\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers_Rooftop\" title=\"Moonrise Towers Rooftop\">Moonrise Towers Rooftop</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-153&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-179</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An instructional missive to zealots of the Absolute offered an audience.]\n</p><p><br>\nTo be seen is to be known, and to be known by Her is most perfect. One must rid one's mind of all veils - nothing can escape Her unseeing gaze, so to hold any secrets before Her is folly. All you have, every little scrap of your being, belongs to Her. In return, you may be offered a fraction of Her being - a shard of perfection lodged in your uncomprehending mind. We are True Souls, after all, and the truth our souls hold is Hers.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715051529\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1617/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30700/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7972/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion d